# Handlebars + DaisyUI

## Layouts

- Pages set `layout: base.hbs` (or `markdown.hbs` for prose).
- `base.hbs` wraps `{{{ content }}}` and includes the navbar.
- `markdown.hbs` nests in `base.hbs` and applies `prose`.

## Partials

- Path = location under `src/_includes/` without extension: `{{> navigation/navbar}}`.
- Pass data as hash args; use `{{{ content }}}` when HTML must not be escaped.
- Category folders: `data-display/`, `layout/`, `navigation/`.

```hbs
{{> data-display/collapse title=title content=html name="group"}}
{{> data-display/accordion items=collections.faqs}}
```

## Styling

- Prefer DaisyUI component classes (`btn`, `navbar`, `collapse`, `menu`, `steps`).
- Match existing responsive patterns (e.g. mobile + desktop nav both updated together).
- Site-wide CSS/theme changes go in `src/assets/css/input.css`, not inline `<style>` blocks.
